  "title": "Phenomenal consciousness is an illusion",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "a1a060f9-3cb6-47cc-b93b-1e2e3b8eac0f",
      "text": "Phenomenal consciousness is an illusion. Experiences do not really have qualitative, what-it’s-like properties, whether physical or non-physical. To say phenomenal properties do not exist means they are not instantiated in this world.",
